<attribute name="goals" nodeId="992e1e78">&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;March 2017&lt;/strong&gt; - removed optional inputs
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;October 2015 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Updated the following tasks:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Define application principles
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Perform package fit/gap analysis
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop development inventory
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Define solution configuration settings
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Establish package application development standards
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Design package application components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Design application batch processing and scheduling
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Updated the following processes:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Design Package Application Components content
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;September 2015 -&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Added the following tasks:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Design application batch processing and scheduling
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Edited the following tasks:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Establish configuration standards tasks split into 2 tasks: Define initial configuration settings and Define
        solution configuration settings
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Edited the following outputs:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Establish package application configuration standards outputs Development Standards (instead of Configuration
        Standards)
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;April&amp;nbsp;2015 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;revised based on refactoring of library around core
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;April 2014 -&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;restructured based on new standards
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;February 2014 -&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;initial release
